{
  "language_code": "eng",
  "language_probability": 1.0,
  "text": "Spire sentinel neutralized. Summit catwalk secured. Pressure is stabilizing at the cyber nexus intake. My boots are still humming from that climb, and now an airlock built to survive bombardment. Of course. Look down through the haze. No shield over the skyline. The city is awake. Remember who we are doing this for. The Nexus is still running. Leave its factories online, and they can rebuild that defense grid within hours. I can feel it through the deck. So many linked processors. A hive of stolen signals behind one bulkhead. Terminal override accepted. Security is folding. Stand clear. The pressure seal is breaking. Atmospheric purge complete. Intake airlock opening. Quantum mainframe chambers confirmed beyond the threshold. Optical conduits, floating prisms, laser baffles, a whole labyrinth. We will have to watch every step. Then we tread carefully and strike deep. Silence the Nexus core. Axiom force through the airlock.",
